# Project Knowhow

Before implementing features, schema, or UI changes, read the relevant files under `.cursor/knowhow/`:

| File | Use when |
|------|----------|
| `know-how.md` | Structure, Drift schema, providers, commands |
| `system-features.md` | Product flows, screens, ledger event types |
| `coding-convention.md` | Dart/Flutter naming and patterns |
| `decisions.md` | Architecture decisions — do not contradict without re-evaluating |
| `lessons-learned.md` | Past mistakes to avoid |

Prefer these over guessing. Update knowhow when you change schema, ledger rules, or established patterns.
